WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 1]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:41.180 --> 01:44.820
[Changsha Military Hospital]

02:01.380 --> 02:02.980
[Ward 8]

02:52.830 --> 02:54.570
A patient this late?

03:25.520 --> 03:26.850
Ms. Head Nurse, something is going on!

03:27.310 --> 03:28.440
Please come with me.

03:39.870 --> 03:40.500
Sir.

03:40.630 --> 03:42.010
What is happening?

03:44.000 --> 03:44.540
[401 Zhang Zhide]
Sir?

03:45.680 --> 03:47.220
[401 Zhang Yuanhang]
They are stoic.

03:47.220 --> 03:48.260
[401 Zhang Zhexi]

03:48.360 --> 03:49.890
Unit 401?

03:50.830 --> 03:52.130
They are Master Zhang's people.

03:53.380 --> 03:54.820
Gather everyone here.

03:55.280 --> 03:55.820
Okay.

04:38.870 --> 04:40.170
Be careful!

04:40.430 --> 04:41.410
Clean it up.

05:09.860 --> 05:14.700
[Changsha Military Hospital]

06:11.980 --> 06:16.000
[Changsha Military Hospital]

06:16.000 --> 06:17.490
One. Two. One.

06:19.240 --> 06:20.020
Halt!

06:20.880 --> 06:22.460
Turn left. Turn right.

06:42.020 --> 06:48.300
[Zhang Qishan, Changsha Defense Commander]

06:55.190 --> 06:57.660
Master, Unit 401 has vanished.

06:57.660 --> 06:59.000
[Zhang Xiaoyu, Zhang Qishan's Adjutant]

06:59.000 --> 07:00.140
Nurse Xu, the witness, claimed

07:00.870 --> 07:02.370
they came for a checkup

07:02.870 --> 07:03.700
around 11:30 PM.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.250
Our records

07:05.430 --> 07:06.700
indicate this unit is repairing the moat

07:07.040 --> 07:08.100
under your command.

07:08.380 --> 07:09.660
[Derun Gate]

07:09.680 --> 07:10.460
Keep it up.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.290
- Take this. - Okay.

07:13.560 --> 07:14.170
Zhang Yuanhang.

07:14.190 --> 07:14.980
Go there.

07:15.000 --> 07:15.930
- Okay. - Bring two over here.

07:16.520 --> 07:17.340
Careful.

07:18.360 --> 07:19.610
- Is Zhang Duo here? - Watch out.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.540
Peiwu.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.610
I need manpower here.

07:21.710 --> 07:22.770
Put it here.

07:22.800 --> 07:23.440
Careful.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.640
At 5 PM,

07:32.000 --> 07:33.370
the superintendent inspected the site.

07:34.000 --> 07:34.700
Nothing was unusual.

07:34.720 --> 07:35.810
Everything was right on track.

08:01.690 --> 08:02.340
No prints

08:02.680 --> 08:03.780
outside of the hospital.

08:04.600 --> 08:05.610
127 men

08:06.040 --> 08:07.810
vanished in an enclosed place.

08:10.480 --> 08:11.930
Don't come near me.

08:13.680 --> 08:15.170
Don't come near me.

08:16.190 --> 08:17.780
Don't come near me.

08:18.120 --> 08:18.900
Don't come near me.

08:21.360 --> 08:21.900
Master.

08:22.430 --> 08:23.170
Her name is Xu Yuan.

08:23.830 --> 08:24.700
The only survivor in the hospital.

08:24.800 --> 08:25.540
Don't come near me.

08:25.830 --> 08:26.700
She's emotionally unstable right now

08:27.160 --> 08:28.020
and might attack you.

08:34.630 --> 08:35.370
Don't come near me.

08:35.600 --> 08:36.460
Don't come near me!

08:39.720 --> 08:40.580
I won't hurt you.

08:41.840 --> 08:42.850
I'm here to help.

08:43.840 --> 08:44.420
Trust me.

08:51.670 --> 08:53.340
Do you know how they vanished?

08:57.510 --> 08:58.220
Over there.

09:02.910 --> 09:04.650
They suddenly vanished over there.

09:04.790 --> 09:05.730
So sudden.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.730
When did it begin raining?

09:14.600 --> 09:15.770
After dusk.

09:16.790 --> 09:17.940
It was already raining when Unit 401

09:17.960 --> 09:18.820
came here.

09:19.750 --> 09:20.340
But no traces

09:21.120 --> 09:22.250
were left in the hospital.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.300
If they didn't walk in from outside,

09:27.150 --> 09:29.490
they must have crawled up from underground.

09:32.720 --> 09:33.130
Come.

09:34.720 --> 09:36.730
Let's find the secret passage in the hospital.

11:04.960 --> 11:05.910
Pry this plank open.

11:06.320 --> 11:06.820
Yes.

11:13.880 --> 11:14.740
There is indeed a hole.

11:15.360 --> 11:16.930
Did they crawl up from here?

11:17.070 --> 11:19.050
And they covered the hole afterwards?

11:38.160 --> 11:38.620
Master.

11:39.230 --> 11:40.500
The mountain underneath has been completely hollowed out.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.290
This is suspicious.

11:41.910 --> 11:42.890
Let's go down and take a look.

11:56.060 --> 11:57.260
[Zhang Xiaojin, Zhang Qishan's Communication Officer]

12:01.390 --> 12:01.890
A wall?

12:02.790 --> 12:03.180
Master.

12:03.790 --> 12:05.420
Why did someone build a wall here?

12:07.510 --> 12:08.580
The answer is below us.

12:23.550 --> 12:24.060
Master,

12:25.240 --> 12:26.130
I found some traces here.

12:37.510 --> 12:38.890
Probably traces of Unit 401's

12:39.200 --> 12:40.700
ascent and descent.

12:51.630 --> 12:52.610
Following the traces,

12:53.270 --> 12:54.180
Unit 401

12:55.240 --> 12:56.180
walked into the wall?

13:13.870 --> 13:15.010
Master, it doesn't make sense.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.820
Weren't they repairing the moat?

13:17.390 --> 13:19.270
How did they end up going in and out of the wall?

13:20.240 --> 13:21.220
Just smoke and mirrors.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.820
Someone wants me to find this place.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.220
They merely used Unit 401.

13:27.960 --> 13:29.370
Search every corner carefully.

13:29.550 --> 13:30.180
Yes!

14:07.870 --> 14:08.300
Master.

14:08.600 --> 14:09.180
I found something.

14:49.390 --> 14:50.340
Over 400 meters deep.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.370
Over 400 meters deep?

14:52.630 --> 14:54.130
That's even longer than Changsha Thoroughfare.

14:54.480 --> 14:55.300
Who built this?

14:56.030 --> 14:56.980
And what for?

14:57.510 --> 14:59.580
To hide what's on the other side, of course.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.250
So, Unit 401

15:33.790 --> 15:35.300
entered the structure behind the wall?

15:36.510 --> 15:37.730
How should we enter, Master?

15:40.150 --> 15:41.370
The mechanism to open the passage

15:41.390 --> 15:42.940
should be inside the tunnel.

15:43.670 --> 15:46.820
At the very least, that's what we're led to believe.

15:48.360 --> 15:49.370
But it's such a small tunnel.

15:49.910 --> 15:50.890
No one could possibly enter.

15:52.120 --> 15:52.490
Master,

15:52.910 --> 15:53.850
I heard

15:54.080 --> 15:55.220
that in ancient times, there was a contraption

15:55.480 --> 15:57.130
whose entrance was very narrow.

15:57.910 --> 15:59.060
Only a child

15:59.080 --> 16:00.370
could get in to decipher it.

16:02.960 --> 16:03.650
Give me the list of missing persons.

16:16.000 --> 16:16.940
There is a child.

16:17.440 --> 16:18.940
Master, I'll have this wall demolished now.

16:19.300 --> 16:20.130
Wait.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.980
Hide it underground,

16:25.480 --> 16:27.420
and it shall be as resilient as the universe.

16:28.030 --> 16:29.220
Hide it underwater,

16:29.640 --> 16:31.780
and it shall withstand a thousand waves.

16:36.350 --> 16:37.370
It's a pebble and lime wall.

16:38.510 --> 16:39.610
It'll take six months to dig through it.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.690
We can't brute-force it.

16:48.840 --> 16:49.820
Bring Eighth Master here.

16:50.270 --> 16:50.730
Master.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.730
You're not on good terms with him.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.060
Will he come?

16:54.270 --> 16:54.850
Just go.

16:55.550 --> 16:55.940
Yes.

16:56.750 --> 16:57.220
Wait.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.820
He probably knows I'll look for him.

17:01.720 --> 17:02.890
So he is already on the run.

17:04.750 --> 17:05.290
Understood.

17:09.660 --> 17:11.980
[Challenge Fate]

17:23.140 --> 17:25.660
[Qi Tiezui, Qi Clan of the Mystic Nine]

17:42.640 --> 17:43.140
Oh, no.

17:44.070 --> 17:44.770
Master Zhang?

17:59.720 --> 18:00.330
Stop.

18:19.880 --> 18:20.330
Sir.

18:20.720 --> 18:22.490
We have to bury the deceased.

18:23.960 --> 18:24.570
How did he die?

18:25.440 --> 18:26.660
He died from the plague.

18:26.830 --> 18:27.980
We have to bury him outside the city.

18:43.240 --> 18:43.890
Let them through.

18:43.890 --> 18:44.660
Let them through!

18:44.960 --> 18:45.380
Go.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.050
What is going on?

19:13.110 --> 19:14.730
Help!

19:15.110 --> 19:17.140
Help!

19:37.070 --> 19:37.980
Master Zhang?

19:38.350 --> 19:39.290
What are you doing here?

19:43.000 --> 19:44.010
Am I in the afterlife?

19:47.000 --> 19:48.290
Are you dead too?

19:52.350 --> 19:53.380
You have no idea.

19:53.640 --> 19:54.180
Today,

19:54.640 --> 19:56.290
I had an excruciating chest pain.

19:56.920 --> 19:58.980
It was hard to breathe and I...

20:00.270 --> 20:01.290
Master Zhang!

20:03.160 --> 20:04.140
Someone lured me here

20:04.270 --> 20:05.490
so that I could discover this place.

20:06.070 --> 20:07.530
Unit 401 might be inside.

20:07.830 --> 20:08.700
You know contraptions well.

20:09.000 --> 20:09.940
Tell us what you see.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.100
Then, we'll bury you properly.

20:12.110 --> 20:13.370
But I...

20:13.640 --> 20:14.050
Speak.

20:26.830 --> 20:27.800
Pianzuo laying method?

20:28.920 --> 20:32.050
It's taller and narrower than the old bricks in Changsha.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.420
But the bricks are not that old.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.620
Hardly a century old.

20:35.920 --> 20:36.860
But in the past century,

20:36.920 --> 20:38.140
who would build such a high wall?

20:38.270 --> 20:39.860
Only the Qin people can do this.

20:39.880 --> 20:40.900
The bricks intersect

20:41.000 --> 20:41.660
with each other,

20:41.670 --> 20:42.460
but they are not symmetrical.

20:42.510 --> 20:43.460
3:7 split.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.530
1:9 split.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.570
2:8 split.

20:55.070 --> 20:56.380
Master Zhang, look.

21:00.680 --> 21:03.140
You cannot demolish this wall.

21:03.510 --> 21:04.490
This is a xingxiu seal.

21:04.830 --> 21:07.370
Each brick is carefully placed.

21:07.440 --> 21:08.660
Take one out

21:08.660 --> 21:10.520
and the entire wall will collapse.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.220
What does a xingxiu seal mean?

21:13.440 --> 21:16.330
It means this is not a tomb.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.700
It's a living house.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.810
Wait.

21:25.270 --> 21:27.090
Someone is living behind the wall?

21:27.640 --> 21:28.420
Impossible.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.860
Who can possibly live underneath Changsha?

21:31.200 --> 21:32.660
But that's what the wall says.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.810
Master Zhang, the house behind this wall

21:36.110 --> 21:37.330
is a living place.

21:37.510 --> 21:38.290
Who stays inside?

21:38.640 --> 21:40.140
They brought Unit 401 in.

21:40.640 --> 21:42.570
Why would they need soldiers, doctors, and nurses?

21:44.640 --> 21:45.420
Is anyone in there?

21:46.110 --> 21:47.810
Come out and let's talk.

21:48.030 --> 21:50.050
This is a peculiar matter.

21:50.070 --> 21:50.810
Eighth Master.

21:51.240 --> 21:52.900
Please tell us how to solve the contraption on the wall.

21:53.680 --> 21:54.490
Show him the way.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.730
If you can hear me,

22:07.270 --> 22:08.530
please open the wall

22:09.000 --> 22:09.810
and let us in.

22:11.720 --> 22:13.010
We can talk.

22:13.750 --> 22:14.380
Is anyone in there?

22:15.440 --> 22:16.140
Is anyone in there?

22:22.440 --> 22:22.900
Eighth Master.

22:23.510 --> 22:25.180
How do we solve the contraption here?

22:25.350 --> 22:26.460
When are you going to crawl inside?

22:26.920 --> 22:27.900
I can't crawl inside.

22:28.220 --> 22:30.010
Master Zhang asked me to explain the contraption,

22:30.090 --> 22:31.380
not solve it.

22:31.720 --> 22:32.770
Don't you know spells?

22:33.270 --> 22:33.860
Shut up.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.290
Don't waste our time, Eighth Master.

22:36.750 --> 22:38.900
Maybe you don't know how to solve it. You're just buying time.

22:40.510 --> 22:42.620
I know someone who can.

22:43.310 --> 22:43.770
Who?

22:45.480 --> 22:46.460
Quit being mysterious.

22:46.480 --> 22:47.090
Just tell us already.

22:48.590 --> 22:49.900
Wu Laogou.

22:57.270 --> 22:58.330
Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

22:58.830 --> 22:59.770
How will he crawl in?

23:00.810 --> 23:02.530
He can't.

23:03.070 --> 23:04.940
But his dog can.

23:06.880 --> 23:08.140
Since this concerns the Zhang Clan,

23:08.920 --> 23:09.940
he probably won't help.

23:11.480 --> 23:13.050
Wu Laogou will just be a nuisance anyway.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.250
If a human can't fit inside,

23:14.480 --> 23:14.980
a dog can't either.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.980
I see you don't know anything about his dog.

23:18.350 --> 23:19.620
His dog

23:19.850 --> 23:21.570
is not an ordinary dog.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.860
How so?

23:23.830 --> 23:24.900
Zhang Xiaojin, you just came back,

23:24.960 --> 23:25.770
so you might not know this.

23:26.310 --> 23:28.090
Five years ago in Changsha City,

23:28.110 --> 23:30.220
there was a once-in-a-century storm in Changsha City.

23:30.550 --> 23:32.570
The Xiang River rose tremendously.

23:32.570 --> 23:33.250
Check that place.

23:33.440 --> 23:35.010
- Many houses - Quick.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.840
- collapsed - You two, go up there.

23:36.840 --> 23:38.960
- because of the rain.
- You two, go there.

23:39.160 --> 23:39.960
There's a survivor here.

23:40.070 --> 23:42.900
- Wu Laogou's brother, Wu Tie,
- Are you there? Make a sound!

23:42.920 --> 23:44.290
[Wu Tie, Wu Laogou's Elder Brother]
- brought his men and dogs - Hello?

23:44.790 --> 23:46.180
to rescue survivors tirelessly.

23:46.350 --> 23:47.530
Wherever a dog barks,

23:47.640 --> 23:48.420
it means someone is there.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.290
Wake up, my friend.

23:55.310 --> 23:55.940
Later,

23:56.480 --> 23:58.140
a landslide cut across the mountain path.

23:58.510 --> 23:59.460
The food supplies couldn't come in.

24:00.030 --> 24:00.570
Unexpectedly, the starving villagers

24:00.590 --> 24:02.180
- killed the dogs - Doggie.

24:02.240 --> 24:04.250
- who saved them to feed themselves.
- Doggie.

24:14.380 --> 24:15.160
[Peaceful Years]

24:15.160 --> 24:16.330
The offender, Wu Tie,

24:16.550 --> 24:17.530
committed homicide.

24:18.160 --> 24:20.810
He will be given the death penalty in accordance with Section 282

24:20.960 --> 24:22.290
of the Criminal Code (of the Republic of China).

24:22.510 --> 24:23.530
He will be executed immediately.

24:26.110 --> 24:26.660
Stop!

24:39.220 --> 24:43.660
[Wu Laogou, from Wu Clan of the Mystic Nine]

24:44.510 --> 24:45.090
Laogou.

25:08.830 --> 25:10.140
Zhang Qishan!

25:16.000 --> 25:16.770
Anyway,

25:16.770 --> 25:17.570
let's drop it.

25:17.720 --> 25:18.640
Regardless,

25:18.880 --> 25:19.530
Fifth Master

25:19.720 --> 25:21.530
will not help you out here.

25:32.160 --> 25:33.220
Master Zhang.

25:33.960 --> 25:36.050
I totally get your message.

25:37.070 --> 25:37.620
I'll go.

25:38.030 --> 25:39.620
I'll convince Fifth Master.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.570
I'll go right now.

25:43.590 --> 25:43.940
Wait.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.010
You've been talking so much

25:46.270 --> 25:47.490
that your legs must be sore.

25:47.790 --> 25:48.490
We'll send you back

25:49.310 --> 25:50.050
the way you came in.

25:51.160 --> 25:51.770
Are we there yet?

25:52.750 --> 25:53.570
[Wu's Residence]
Let me out!

25:53.920 --> 25:54.860
[Wu's Residence]
Let me out now!

25:56.680 --> 25:57.290
Is anyone there?

25:58.240 --> 25:59.460
Come out now, prick.

25:59.480 --> 26:00.380
How dare you put

26:01.030 --> 26:02.940
a coffin before the Wu's Residence?

26:03.310 --> 26:04.220
Take it away now.

26:04.560 --> 26:05.380
Don't!

26:05.400 --> 26:06.900
Don't take it away.

26:07.160 --> 26:07.940
It's me.

26:08.390 --> 26:09.490
Tiezui.

26:10.030 --> 26:10.530
Juanlian.

26:10.530 --> 26:11.240
[Wu Tianpeng, Wu Clan's Mason]

26:11.240 --> 26:11.810
It's Eighth Master.

26:11.810 --> 26:12.860
[Wu Juanlian, Wu Clan's Superintendent]

26:13.590 --> 26:14.460
Oh, my friends,

26:14.640 --> 26:16.050
please tell your master

26:16.590 --> 26:17.620
that I'm here, and I'm Laogou.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.380
And let me out now.

26:19.880 --> 26:20.420
Eighth Master.

26:20.830 --> 26:21.660
It's not up to us

26:21.880 --> 26:23.220
to release you.

26:23.310 --> 26:24.330
If you want to be free,

26:24.640 --> 26:26.290
you'll have to wait for my master to be here.

26:26.750 --> 26:27.620
What?

26:28.110 --> 26:29.940
When did this ever become a rule in your clan?

26:30.030 --> 26:31.140
Go tell your master that Master Zhang

26:31.270 --> 26:32.490
forced me to talk to him.

26:32.510 --> 26:33.220
I didn't want to be here either.

26:33.270 --> 26:34.220
I was coerced.

26:34.590 --> 26:36.290
An odd event often foretells the arrival of an omen.

26:37.480 --> 26:38.810
Zhang Qishan is definitely

26:38.830 --> 26:39.940
up to no good.

26:42.920 --> 26:44.570
He placed you in front of my residence.

26:46.270 --> 26:47.530
That's fishy.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.730
Laogou.

26:51.510 --> 26:53.050
Remember what you promised me

26:53.070 --> 26:53.690
when I cleared up your mess

26:53.690 --> 26:54.460
last year?

26:55.310 --> 26:56.250
I now want you

26:56.510 --> 26:57.420
to get me out of here.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.050
You want to get out?

27:02.240 --> 27:02.900
Sure.

27:03.350 --> 27:05.660
The lid is not fastened anyway. Don't play the victim now.

27:06.960 --> 27:08.940
Fifth Master, get it away from me.

27:09.050 --> 27:09.700
Fifth Master!

27:11.880 --> 27:12.940
Fifth Master!

27:13.310 --> 27:14.460
Get it away from me!

27:15.670 --> 27:16.380
Xiaozhu.

27:23.750 --> 27:24.530
I almost died there.

27:28.350 --> 27:29.050
Xiaozhu.

27:29.790 --> 27:31.010
Watch Eighth Master's feet.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.050
If he leaves the coffin,

27:33.480 --> 27:34.220
bite him to death.

27:35.720 --> 27:36.330
Laogou.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.570
You're being really disloyal.

27:37.930 --> 27:38.570
Tiezui.

27:39.550 --> 27:40.810
If you were in trouble today,

27:41.400 --> 27:43.140
I would save you without any hesitation.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.940
But you are on Master Zhang's side.

27:47.880 --> 27:49.090
And that broke my heart.

27:49.830 --> 27:51.530
I failed to kill him, but killing you is easy.

27:51.960 --> 27:53.070
What were you thinking? Seriously.

27:53.070 --> 27:53.620
Laogou.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.180
I was forced.

27:55.590 --> 27:56.380
Master Zhang said

27:56.720 --> 27:57.810
that if you could assist him,

27:58.030 --> 27:59.220
he could do anything for you.

28:03.200 --> 28:04.050
Sure.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.570
I only want Zhang Qishan dead.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.620
That's too much to ask for.

28:10.480 --> 28:12.090
After he took over Changsha,

28:12.480 --> 28:13.730
this place has become more peaceful.

28:14.590 --> 28:15.490
He cleared out

28:15.550 --> 28:16.730
all the Japanese agents, didn't he?

28:17.110 --> 28:18.330
His merit makes up for his wrongdoing.

28:19.200 --> 28:20.090
Let's just

28:20.400 --> 28:21.530
bury the hatchet.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.900
You're right.

28:28.720 --> 28:29.180
Laogou.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.490
Let me kill you first.

28:32.720 --> 28:34.330
Then, I'll clean up your house.

28:34.830 --> 28:35.620
That way,

28:36.680 --> 28:38.290
my merit makes up for my wrongdoing, and we're even.

28:39.000 --> 28:39.770
Juanlian, Tianpeng.

28:39.920 --> 28:40.420
Yes, Master.

28:40.790 --> 28:42.420
If Eighth Master does not comply,

28:42.590 --> 28:43.730
set up a pot.

28:44.160 --> 28:45.290
Give the dogs an extra meal.

28:45.550 --> 28:46.010
Steam him?

28:46.030 --> 28:46.530
Or braise him?

28:47.110 --> 28:47.810
It won't come to that.

28:47.960 --> 28:48.810
Please don't, my friends.

28:48.920 --> 28:49.530
Don't do that.

28:51.720 --> 28:52.460
Come on.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.420
Look at you.

28:54.640 --> 28:56.330
Stop threatening to kill people.

28:56.790 --> 28:57.490
I did come

28:57.920 --> 28:59.620
with a great offer.

29:00.070 --> 29:01.380
Why don't you hear me out first

29:01.440 --> 29:02.700
before eating me?

29:02.790 --> 29:03.330
Okay?

29:06.310 --> 29:08.570
You're so dedicated to Zhang Qishan's cause today.

29:09.270 --> 29:10.460
Whose side are you on?

29:11.750 --> 29:13.220
Your side, of course, Fifth Master.

29:13.550 --> 29:14.380
Zhang Qishan...

29:16.310 --> 29:17.620
Zhang Qishan is nothing.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.900
Did you hear that?

29:24.160 --> 29:25.570
Insulting the Defense Commander of Changsha

29:25.590 --> 29:27.090
in public.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.140
- No. - The audacity!

29:28.160 --> 29:28.620
No.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.090
Come.

29:29.510 --> 29:30.490
Put him back in the coffin.

29:30.790 --> 29:32.530
We'll blanch out the filth, fry everything, and eat it.

29:32.680 --> 29:33.250
- Yes! - Yes!

29:33.640 --> 29:35.010
Don't!

29:35.030 --> 29:35.490
Fifth Master!

29:35.510 --> 29:35.900
Fifth Master!

29:36.350 --> 29:37.620
Master Zhang tried to kill me.

29:37.640 --> 29:38.490
And now you too?

29:38.680 --> 29:40.570
Can you two please spare me?

29:40.680 --> 29:41.220
Spare you?

29:44.270 --> 29:45.770
You know very well what happened

29:46.310 --> 29:47.180
back then.

29:49.510 --> 29:50.490
Do you think I'll ever help

29:50.510 --> 29:51.420
Zhang Qishan?

29:57.510 --> 29:58.250
About that matter,

29:58.960 --> 30:00.420
Master Zhang had no choice but to do what he did.

30:01.160 --> 30:02.730
He is the Defense Commander of Changsha.

30:03.270 --> 30:04.730
What do you expect him to do?

30:05.440 --> 30:06.490
What if it was his family on the line?

30:10.160 --> 30:11.490
Laogou, you see.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.700
You and he need to meet up and talk this out.

30:14.510 --> 30:16.180
He has changed a lot over these years.

30:16.310 --> 30:18.250
And this time,

30:18.270 --> 30:19.700
hundreds of lives are at stake.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.860
Hundreds.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.530
Think it over.

30:34.550 --> 30:35.290
Laogou.

30:36.770 --> 30:37.610
Stay

30:38.200 --> 30:39.050
out of this.

30:41.720 --> 30:43.700
Ask Zhang Qishan to negotiate with me in person.

30:44.510 --> 30:45.050
Fifth Master.

30:45.790 --> 30:48.010
Do we have a deal?

30:48.550 --> 30:49.620
We have a deal.

30:49.960 --> 30:50.900
A deal is a deal!

31:03.550 --> 31:04.660
Judging from the color

31:05.200 --> 31:06.810
of these underground bricks, they're no more than 80 years old.

31:07.720 --> 31:09.250
A basalt brick

31:09.720 --> 31:11.090
mixed with gold threads during molding

31:11.110 --> 31:11.900
to increase its strength.

31:12.960 --> 31:13.530
This kind of brick

31:14.070 --> 31:15.810
can't be produced by ordinary kilns at all.

31:16.310 --> 31:17.810
There must be a huge kiln factory nearby.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.140
Master,

31:19.880 --> 31:22.050
I have gone through all major kiln factories around Changsha.

31:22.790 --> 31:24.090
Only five factories fit the criteria.

31:24.350 --> 31:26.250
They are Fayuan, Tianxin,

31:26.350 --> 31:27.460
Liuyang, Xiangtan,

31:27.550 --> 31:28.530
and Hengyang.

31:30.310 --> 31:32.420
The making of basalt will release

31:32.640 --> 31:33.900
a lot of smoke.

31:34.590 --> 31:36.570
So the factory will not be in the city

31:36.960 --> 31:38.940
or in the mountains where transportation is difficult.

31:40.640 --> 31:41.180
Then...

31:43.680 --> 31:44.620
Let's visit Liuyang Kiln.

31:45.740 --> 31:50.060
[Liuyang Kiln]

32:08.960 --> 32:09.490
Master,

32:10.270 --> 32:11.460
this should be where they made

32:11.480 --> 32:12.700
the gold thread basalt bricks.

32:29.550 --> 32:30.220
Master.

32:41.200 --> 32:41.860
Master.

32:42.270 --> 32:43.730
This was once a kiln.

32:44.000 --> 32:45.290
But during our investigation,

32:45.550 --> 32:47.660
we discovered that there was another wall inside.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.700
They might be hiding

32:49.720 --> 32:50.860
something illegal inside.

33:22.790 --> 33:23.290
Master.

33:24.070 --> 33:25.570
These were probably the kiln workers.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.140
They were all killed.

33:45.280 --> 33:46.290
They all killed themselves.

34:03.560 --> 34:04.730
They did not hesitate either.

34:06.110 --> 34:07.560
The cultists probably were told

34:07.560 --> 34:09.420
that they would be rewarded after death.

34:10.550 --> 34:12.340
They formed the taiji diagram with their bodies.

34:13.590 --> 34:16.170
What a fanatical ritual.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.490
Karma will uncover itself.

34:36.960 --> 34:38.490
My Sovereign awaits you.

34:40.670 --> 34:41.210
Master.

34:41.880 --> 34:43.090
What does "My Sovereign" mean?

34:43.920 --> 34:46.690
It might have something to do with the cult.

34:47.190 --> 34:47.900
It seems like

34:48.630 --> 34:50.300
the one who had built the huge underground wall

34:51.000 --> 34:53.610
already knew we would investigate and trace it here.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.380
[Karma will uncover itself.]
So they deliberately left these messages

34:55.380 --> 34:56.230
[My Sovereign awaits you.]

34:56.230 --> 34:57.300
to taunt us.

34:57.440 --> 34:59.740
They sure are bold.

35:01.670 --> 35:02.170
Master.

35:02.800 --> 35:03.340
Master.

35:03.880 --> 35:04.650
Eighth Master Qi said

35:04.840 --> 35:05.900
that Wu Laogou agreed to meet up.

35:11.960 --> 35:14.690
- Bravo! - Bravo!

35:15.710 --> 35:16.170
Well played!

35:16.440 --> 35:17.340
- Bravo. - Very nice.

35:17.760 --> 35:19.780
- Bravo! - Bravo!

35:19.920 --> 35:20.490
What a play!

35:30.000 --> 35:32.740
- Bravo! - Bravo!

35:34.520 --> 35:35.150
Impressive.

35:35.200 --> 35:35.580
Let's go.

35:36.820 --> 35:39.560
[Pear Garden]

35:39.560 --> 35:41.620
Master, aren't you going to finish it?

35:42.150 --> 35:44.580
Why must we always leave during this act?

35:46.030 --> 35:47.740
The monkey will be captured next.

35:48.190 --> 35:49.090
I don't like the ending.

35:50.000 --> 35:51.690
The monkey made a mess.

35:51.910 --> 35:52.660
Shouldn't it be captured?

35:53.590 --> 35:55.370
The Jade Emperor and his immortals

35:55.390 --> 35:56.410
only cared about the persecution.

35:56.910 --> 35:57.940
They never once asked why

35:58.390 --> 36:00.340
the monkey made a mess in the first place.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.210
That's because the monkey did not like

36:05.400 --> 36:06.940
the rules set by the immortals.

36:08.150 --> 36:09.180
Bad rules

36:10.110 --> 36:11.180
need to be amended.

36:11.750 --> 36:14.050
Master, are you meeting with Zhang Qishan for real?

36:16.280 --> 36:17.730
I have a bad hunch about it.

36:18.600 --> 36:20.260
This must be a trap he set up.

36:20.880 --> 36:21.980
A journey to the West.

36:22.360 --> 36:23.860
And my journey has gone on long enough.

36:24.920 --> 36:26.160
It seems like Zhang Qishan's ego

36:27.110 --> 36:28.940
has soared higher than the sky.

36:29.590 --> 36:30.980
He clearly knows I hate him so much,

36:33.150 --> 36:34.420
but he still asks for my help.

36:35.400 --> 36:36.380
Juanlian. Tianpeng.

36:37.230 --> 36:40.010
The time to turn everything upside down will soon be upon us.

36:56.860 --> 37:01.020
♪The past fades like smoke♪

37:01.380 --> 37:04.100
♪A choice is made in silence♪

37:04.380 --> 37:07.180
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

37:07.580 --> 37:11.340
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

37:11.580 --> 37:15.020
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

37:15.300 --> 37:18.700
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

37:18.780 --> 37:26.060
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

37:26.500 --> 37:29.780
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

37:30.060 --> 37:33.300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

37:33.460 --> 37:37.500
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

37:37.700 --> 37:41.060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

37:41.300 --> 37:44.660
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

37:44.900 --> 37:48.180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

37:48.500 --> 37:52.180
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

37:52.380 --> 37:55.620
♪Take care♪

37:55.620 --> 37:58.180
♪We once raced♪

37:58.260 --> 38:00.180
♪For the dawn♪

38:00.340 --> 38:03.620
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

38:03.740 --> 38:07.020
♪In the web of fate♪

38:07.020 --> 38:10.220
♪No one can escape♪

38:11.220 --> 38:13.060
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

38:13.220 --> 38:14.780
♪We too were young once♪

38:14.860 --> 38:18.300
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

38:18.500 --> 38:20.820
♪Keep the ember lit♪

38:20.940 --> 38:25.460
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

38:25.580 --> 38:28.540
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

38:28.780 --> 38:32.300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

38:32.420 --> 38:36.180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

38:36.500 --> 38:39.980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

38:40.140 --> 38:43.140
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

38:43.380 --> 38:47.140
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

38:47.300 --> 38:51.020
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

38:51.140 --> 39:02.580
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
